---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Press Kit — SENTINEL MAN" description="Press resources for Sentinel Man — brand, logos, founder bio, fact sheet, and press contact.">
  <div class="content-wrap">
    <div class="content-hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">PRESS KIT</div>
      <h1>For journalists,<br /><strong>writers, and editors.</strong></h1>
      <p class="lead">Everything you need to write about SENTINEL MAN. Logos, founder bio, fact sheet, and a direct contact for interview requests.</p>
    </div>

    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">PRESS CONTACT</div>
      <h2>One inbox. <strong>Subject: PRESS.</strong></h2>
      <div class="press-contact">
        <a href="mailto:support@sentinelman.com?subject=PRESS" class="press-email">support@sentinelman.com</a>
        <p>Mark your subject line <code>PRESS</code> and we will route to the founder. Response within 48 hours AEST, Monday to Friday.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">ONE-LINE DESCRIPTIONS</div>
      <h2>For copy and lead.</h2>
      <div class="press-lines">
        <div class="press-line">
          <div class="press-line-label">SHORT (10 WORDS)</div>
          <div class="press-line-text">Performance intelligence system for high-stakes men. Daily AI command brief.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="press-line">
          <div class="press-line-label">STANDARD (30 WORDS)</div>
          <div class="press-line-text">SENTINEL MAN is an AI performance intelligence system for high-stakes men. It tracks operational state, analyses decisions across four AI lanes, and delivers a daily command brief — in performance language, not wellness language.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="press-line">
          <div class="press-line-label">EXTENDED (60 WORDS)</div>
          <div class="press-line-text">SENTINEL MAN is a performance intelligence system built for men who reject wellness framing. The product runs four AI models in parallel to analyse decisions, builds a personal pattern model from daily check-ins, and delivers operational intelligence rather than therapeutic content. Founded by Nick Lord in Sydney, 2026, after years using a private version of the same methodology.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">FOUNDER</div>
      <h2>Nick Lord.</h2>
      <div class="founder-card">
        <div class="founder-avatar">NL</div>
        <div>
          <div class="founder-name">Nick Lord</div>
          <div class="founder-title">FOUNDER · SENTINEL MAN · SYDNEY, AUSTRALIA</div>
          <div class="founder-bio">Nick Lord is the founder of SOVEREIGN OS — a decision governance methodology and operational system he built for his own use after concluding that no existing framework handled the complexity of high-stakes decision-making at the pace modern business requires. He has operated across business building, coaching, and AI product development. SENTINEL MAN is the consumer expression of the operational intelligence system he has used to govern his own decisions for years.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="press-aux">For interview requests, send a brief outline of the angle and proposed format to <a href="mailto:support@sentinelman.com?subject=PRESS%20-%20Interview%20Request">support@sentinelman.com</a> with subject <code>PRESS — Interview Request</code>.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">FACT SHEET</div>
      <h2>The numbers.</h2>
      <div class="fact-grid">
        <div class="fact-row"><span class="fact-label">Product</span><span class="fact-val">SENTINEL MAN — performance intelligence system</span></div>
        <div class="fact-row"><span class="fact-label">Operator</span><span class="fact-val">My Cosmic Message Pty Ltd · ABN 30 652 358 159</span></div>
        <div class="fact-row"><span class="fact-label">Trading as</span><span class="fact-val">WOW Enterprise Company</span></div>
        <div class="fact-row"><span class="fact-label">Headquarters</span><span class="fact-val">Sydney, Australia</span></div>
        <div class="fact-row"><span class="fact-label">Launch</span><span class="fact-val">2026 · iOS, Android, Web</span></div>
        <div class="fact-row"><span class="fact-label">Pricing (web)</span><span class="fact-val">$19.99 AUD/month · $199 AUD/year</span></div>
        <div class="fact-row"><span class="fact-label">Trial</span><span class="fact-val">7 days · No credit card required</span></div>
        <div class="fact-row"><span class="fact-label">Decision Advisor lanes</span><span class="fact-val">4 AI models in parallel · 26-second synthesis</span></div>
        <div class="fact-row"><span class="fact-label">Transformation arc</span><span class="fact-val">90 days · 9 designed milestones</span></div>
        <div class="fact-row"><span class="fact-label">Clinical methodology</span><span class="fact-val">19 evidence-based modalities embedded invisibly</span></div>
        <div class="fact-row"><span class="fact-label">Data residency</span><span class="fact-val">Australian-region infrastructure</span></div>
        <div class="fact-row"><span class="fact-label">Audience</span><span class="fact-val">Men 30–60 in operational roles · founders, directors, partners</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">BRAND ASSETS</div>
      <h2>Logos. <strong>Right-click to save.</strong></h2>
      <div class="press-assets">
        <div class="press-asset">
          <a href="/logo.png" download="sentinel-man-logo.png" class="asset-tile">
            <img src="/logo.png" alt="Sentinel Man logo" />
          </a>
          <div class="asset-meta">
            <div class="asset-name">Primary logo</div>
            <div class="asset-spec">PNG · 1024×1024 · Gold on navy</div>
            <a href="/logo.png" download="sentinel-man-logo.png" class="asset-download">Download →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="press-asset">
          <a href="/og-image.png" download="sentinel-man-og.png" class="asset-tile asset-tile-wide">
            <img src="/og-image.png" alt="Sentinel Man social card" />
          </a>
          <div class="asset-meta">
            <div class="asset-name">Social share card</div>
            <div class="asset-spec">PNG · 1200×630 · For article inline use</div>
            <a href="/og-image.png" download="sentinel-man-og.png" class="asset-download">Download →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="press-aux">Brand colours: <code>#001F3F</code> (navy) · <code>#FFDC00</code> (gold) · <code>#0D0D1A</code> (midnight). Typefaces: JetBrains Mono, Rubik. Please do not alter the logo, recolour it, or place it on backgrounds that compromise legibility.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <div class="eyebrow">USAGE GUIDELINES</div>
      <h2>How to <strong>frame us.</strong></h2>
      <div class="press-guides">
        <div class="press-guide ok">
          <div class="press-guide-head">PREFERRED</div>
          <ul>
            <li>"Performance intelligence system"</li>
            <li>"AI decision intelligence for men"</li>
            <li>"A men-focused operational intelligence platform"</li>
            <li>"Built for men who reject wellness framing"</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="press-guide no">
          <div class="press-guide-head">PLEASE AVOID</div>
          <ul>
            <li>"Mental health app"</li>
            <li>"Wellness platform" or "self-care app"</li>
            <li>"Therapy alternative" or "AI therapist"</li>
            <li>"Mood tracker" — significantly understates the product</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .press-contact {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    background: rgba(13, 31, 53, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .press-email {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 28px);
    color: var(--gold);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 220, 0, 0.3);
    padding-bottom: 4px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .press-email:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--gold); }
  .press-contact p {
    margin-top: 16px;
    color: var(--secondary);
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .press-contact code {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--gold);
    background: rgba(255, 220, 0, 0.08);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .press-lines { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .press-line {
    background: rgba(13, 31, 53, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 22px 26px;
  }
  .press-line-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .press-line-text {
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--secondary);
  }

  .press-aux {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--body);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  .press-aux a { color: var(--gold); text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,220,0,0.3); }
  .press-aux code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--gold); background: rgba(255,220,0,0.08); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 3px; }

  .fact-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .fact-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    background: rgba(13, 31, 53, 0.4);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 14px 20px;
  }
  .fact-label {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .fact-val { font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--secondary); }

  .press-assets {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .asset-tile {
    display: block;
    background: var(--midnight);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
  }
  .asset-tile:hover { border-color: var(--gold); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .asset-tile img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; }
  .asset-meta {
    margin-top: 14px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .asset-name {
    font-family: 'Rubik', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .asset-spec {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 4px 0 8px;
  }
  .asset-download {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--gold);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .press-guides {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .press-guide {
    background: rgba(13, 31, 53, 0.5);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
  }
  .press-guide.ok { border-left: 3px solid var(--gold); }
  .press-guide.no { border-left: 3px solid #FF5C5C; }
  .press-guide-head {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--gold);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .press-guide.no .press-guide-head { color: #FF5C5C; }
  .press-guide ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  .press-guide li {
    padding: 8px 0;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--secondary);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .press-guide li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .press-assets { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .press-guides { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .fact-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; }
  }
</style>
